{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"范畴论","text":"范畴论"}}]},4],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"title":[{"Plain":"多项式单子"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"多项式单子"},0]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>固定一个基范畴 $\\mathcal C$, 通常为 $\\mathsf{Set}$ 或 $\\mathsf{Ani}$. 记 $\\mathsf{Poly}(\\mathcal C)$ 为切片范畴 $\\mathcal C_{/X}$ 及其之间的"},{"Local":{"url":"多项式函子","text":"多项式函子"}},{"Plain":"以及 "},{"Local":{"url":"Descartes自然变换","text":"Descartes 自然变换"}},{"Plain":"构成的 $2$-范畴.</p>\n<p>定义 $\\mathcal C_{/X}$ 上的<strong>多项式单子</strong> (polynomial monad) 是 $2$-范畴 $\\mathsf{Poly}(\\mathcal C)$ 中 $\\mathcal C_{/X}$ 上的"},{"Local":{"url":"单子","text":"单子"}},{"Plain":", 也即"},{"Local":{"url":"游走的单子","text":"游走的单子"}},{"Plain":"到 $\\mathsf{Poly}$ 的函子\n$$\r\n\\mathsf{Mnd} \\to \\mathsf{Poly},\\ *\\mapsto\\mathcal C_{/X}.\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<h3>自由幺半群</h3>\n<p>自由幺半群单子 (即"},{"Local":{"url":"列表","text":"列表"}},{"Plain":"函子) 是多项式单子.</p>\n"}]}}